@startuml BrewLite_Lightsail_Deployment
title BrewLite - AWS Lightsail Deployment (Task 3.2)

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Customer" as customer
cloud "Internet" as internet {
  node "VNPay Sandbox" as vnp
  artifact "GitHub Repository" as repo
  artifact "GitHub Actions\n(CI/CD - planned)" as actions
}

node "AWS Account" as aws {
  node "AWS Lightsail\nRegion TBD" as lightsail {
    node "Container Service: brewlite-web\nPublic HTTPS endpoint" as webService {
      artifact "Next.js Web container\nport 3000" as web
    }

    node "Container Service: brewlite-api\nPublic HTTPS endpoint\n(Web API + VNPay IPN)" as apiService {
      artifact "NestJS API container\nport 3001" as api
    }

    database "Managed PostgreSQL\nPrivate mode · port 5432" as db

    artifact "brewlite-web image store\ncommit SHA tag" as webImages
    artifact "brewlite-api image store\ncommit SHA tag" as apiImages
  }
}

customer --> webService : HTTPS
customer --> apiService : HTTPS API calls\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
apiService --> customer : Payment URL response
customer --> vnp : Redirect using payment URL
vnp --> apiService : IPN · HTTPS
vnp ..> webService : Return URL via browser
web --> apiService : Server-side API calls\nif used
api --> db : Private network\nDATABASE_URL

repo ..> actions : Workflow trigger
actions ..> webImages : Build/push Web image\nSHA tag
actions ..> apiImages : Build/push API image\nSHA tag
webImages ..> webService : Create deployment
apiImages ..> apiService : Create deployment

note bottom of lightsail
All Lightsail resources must use the same Region.
Topology is a target; AWS resources are not provisioned yet.
end note

note bottom of apiService
CORS allowlist for Web origin; JWT and request validation.
Verify VNPay IPN signature. Return URL does not confirm payment.
end note

note bottom of db
Keep database private. GitHub-hosted runner cannot connect directly;
run migrations from a Lightsail-side job/runner.
end note

@enduml
